WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.003
Hi, my name is Aaron Yuheng Liu.

2
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.972
I'm a senior in Linguistics

3
00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:10.643
and also 4+1 master's student in the GCAT

4
00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:14.280
or Global Communications
and Applied Translation program.

5
00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:19.347
So another part I love about
CMU is the overall learning experience,

6
00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:25.053
including in a rather small degree program
like my Linguistics bachelor's program.

7
00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:31.564
We have approximately 20 students
across the entire university

8
00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:36.564
and three full time professors,
but that also means that basically everyone knows each other.

9
00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.272
The students know each other very well.

10
00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:42.108
The students also know the professors
very well.

11
00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:47.108
And you can follow the teaching and also
the research projects fairly closely.

12
00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:52.285
And there's really a very friendly vibe
in those classrooms.

13
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:56.589
Discussions are always very close
and heated, and overall speaking,

14
00:00:56.589 --> 00:01:00.126
